        'reference: J. J. Kas, F. D. Vila, C. D. Pemmaraju, T. S. Tan and J. J. Rehr, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1107/S1600577521008614" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:' + ACC + '">J. Synchrotron Rad. 28, 1801 (2021)</a> · code: <a href="https://github.com/times-software/feff10" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:' + ACC + '">times-software/feff10</a></div>';
